  "content": "<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">一、上效果</h1>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5u0o081x0d_img1.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5u0o081x0d_img2.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5u0o081x0d_img3.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\">\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/5u0o081x0d_img4.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">二、cursor 聊天整理</h1>\n<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">使用AI开发Chrome扩展：从零开始的网站工具管理器</h1>\n<div>这是一份记录我如何使用AI助手开发Chrome扩展的真实经历。作为一个非专业开发者，我希望这个过程能够帮助到其他想要尝试开发浏览器扩展但不知从何开始的朋友们。</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">🌟 项目介绍：网站工具管理器</h2>\n<div>我想开发一个Chrome扩展，帮助我更好地管理经常访问的网站。这个扩展应该能够：</div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div>将网站分组管理</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>一键打开某个分组中的所有网站</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>记录我的浏览习惯并提供简单的统计</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>支持多种语言（英文、中文、日文）</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">💬 开发过程：我与AI的对话记录</h2>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">第一阶段：构思与基础功能</h3>\n<div><strong>我</strong>：我想开发一个Chrome扩展，可以帮我管理经常访问的网站，可以把它们分组，然后一键打开某个分组里的所有网站。</div>\n<div><strong>AI</strong>：这是个很实用的想法！我们可以使用Chrome的扩展API来实现这个功能。首先需要创建几个基本文件：</div>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div><code>manifest.json</code> - 扩展的配置文件</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><code>popup.html</code> - 点击扩展图标时显示的弹出窗口</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><code>popup.js</code> - 处理用户交互的JavaScript代码</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div><code>styles.css</code> - 美化界面的样式表</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div>我们可以先设计一个简单的界面，包含\"我的网站\"、\"管理分组\"两个标签页。</div>\n<div><strong>我</strong>：听起来不错！我还想添加一个功能，可以记录我访问网站的频率，并且显示一些简单的统计数据。</div>\n<div><strong>AI</strong>：很好的想法！我们可以添加一个\"使用统计\"标签页。为了实现这个功能，我们需要：</div>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div>在<code>manifest.json</code>中添加\"tabs\"和\"history\"权限</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>创建一个<code>background.js</code>文件，在后台监听标签页变化</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>使用Chrome的storage API存储访问数据</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>在统计页面中展示这些数据</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div>下面是基本的文件结构：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>\n</span><span>├── manifest</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">json</span><span> # 扩展配置文件\n</span>\n<span>├── popup</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">html</span><span> # 弹出窗口</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">HTML</span><span>\n</span>\n<span>├── styles</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">css</span><span> # 样式表\n</span>\n<span>├── popup</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">js</span><span> # 主要JavaScript逻辑\n</span>\n<span>└── background</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">js</span><span> # 后台服务脚本\n</span></code></div></pre>\n<div><strong>我</strong>：我还想让这个扩展支持多种语言，至少包括英文、中文和日文。</div>\n<div><strong>AI</strong>：支持多语言是个很好的功能！我们可以这样实现：</div>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<div>创建一个翻译对象，包含所有需要翻译的文本</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>添加一个语言选择器在界面上</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>当用户切换语言时，更新所有界面文本</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div>这是一个简单的实现方式，不需要使用复杂的国际化框架。</div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">第二阶段：功能增强与问题解决</h3>\n<div><strong>我</strong>：我发现当我添加新网站时，每次都要手动输入网站名称和URL，能不能自动填充当前标签页的信息？</div>\n<div><strong>AI</strong>：当然可以！我们可以使用Chrome的tabs API获取当前活动标签页的信息。我们需要：</div>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li>\n<div>在<code>popup.js</code>中添加一个函数来获取当前标签页信息</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>当扩展弹出窗口打开时，自动填充表单</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>还可以添加一个功能，当用户切换标签页时，自动更新表单内容</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div>下面是获取当前标签页信息的代码示例：</div>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">function</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">getCurrentTabInfo</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span>\n<span>chrome</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">tabs</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token method property-access\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">query</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">active</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">true</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span> </span><span class=\"token literal-property\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">currentWindow</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">true</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">,</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">function</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\">tabs</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">if</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span>tabs </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&amp;&amp;</span><span> tabs</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">length</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">&gt;</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">0</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">const</span><span> currentTab </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span> tabs</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">[</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">0</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">]</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token dom\" style=\"color: rgb(238, 153, 0);\">document</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token method property-access\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">getElementById</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'site-name'</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">value</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span> currentTab</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">title</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token dom\" style=\"color: rgb(238, 153, 0);\">document</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token method property-access\" style=\"color: rgb(221, 74, 104);\">getElementById</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">'site-url'</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">value</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">=</span><span> currentTab</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">url</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">)</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span>\n</span></code></div></pre>\n<div><strong>我</strong>：太棒了！我还想添加一个功能，可以给某些网站加星标，然后有一个按钮可以一键打开所有星标网站。</div>\n<div><strong>AI</strong>：这是个很实用的功能！我们可以这样实现：</div>\n<ol start=\"7\">\n<li>\n<div>在网站数据结构中添加一个<code>starred</code>属性</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>在每个网站旁边添加一个星标图标，点击可以切换状态</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>在顶部添加一个\"优先打开\"按钮，点击时打开所有标星的网站</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<div>我们还可以为每个分组添加一个\"全部标星\"按钮，方便用户一次性标记整个分组。</div>\n<h3 style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">第三阶段：用户体验优化</h3>\n<div><strong>我</strong>：我想让这个扩展不只是弹出窗口，还可以在侧边栏中使用，这样我浏览网页时可以同时看到我的网站分组。</div>\n<div><strong>AI</strong>：Chrome确实支持侧边栏扩展！我们需要：</div>\n<ol start=\"10\">\n<li>\n<div>在<code>manifest.json</code>中添加<code>sidePanel</code>配置</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>创建一个<code>panel.html</code>文件作为侧边栏的入口</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>调整CSS样式，使界面在侧边栏中也能良好显示</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-json\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"side_panel\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">\"default_path\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">\"panel.html\"</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span>\n</span></code></div></pre>\n<div><strong>我</strong>：我在测试侧边栏时发现一个问题，内容显示不全，右侧被截断了，需要手动拖动才能看到。</div>\n<div><strong>AI</strong>：这是Chrome侧边栏的一个常见问题。让我们来解决它：</div>\n<ol start=\"13\">\n<li>\n<div>首先检查侧边栏的宽度设置，将<code>body.panel-mode</code>的宽度从420px增加到500px</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>为所有容器元素添加<code>box-sizing: border-box</code>确保内边距不会增加元素实际宽度</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>优化内部元素间距，减小边距和内边距</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div>调整flex布局属性，确保内容能够适应可用空间</div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-css\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>\n</span><span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">body</span><span class=\"token class\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">.panel-mode</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">width</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">100</span><span class=\"token unit\">%</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">max-width</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">100</span><span class=\"token unit\">%</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">height</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">100</span><span class=\"token unit\">vh</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">overflow</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">:</span><span> hidden</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">display</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">:</span><span> flex</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">flex-direction</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">:</span><span> column</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">box-sizing</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">:</span><span> border-box</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">}</span><span>\n</span>\n  \n\n<span></span><span class=\"token class\" style=\"color: rgb(102, 153, 0);\">.tab-container</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">{</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">width</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">100</span><span class=\"token unit\">%</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span>\n</span>\n<span></span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">flex</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">:</span><span> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 0, 85);\">1</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">;</span><span>\n</span>